        "575de4a6c7af76542a4df09c858e948e01d76ae2"
      ],
      "title": "CI,Tools: auto-enable Homebrew updates in CI, remove brew doctor",
      "message": "CI,Tools: auto-enable Homebrew updates in CI, remove brew doctor\n\n* Show brew and homebrew-core versions to learn about available formula.\n* The formula list included with the current macOS image is too old and\n  does not have libnghttp3. Enable auto-updates to resolve this, these\n  are faster than before: https://brew.sh/2023/02/16/homebrew-4.0.0/\n* Disable brew doctor, it breaks CI for non-fatal reasons.\n\n(cherry picked from commit adb4f1d91b24b396218fdee80ea061c0e84caa20)\n",
      "author_name": "Peter Wu",
      "author_email": "peter@lekensteyn.nl",
      "authored_date": "2023-10-16T12:03:35.000+02:00",
      "committer_name": "Peter Wu",
      "committer_email": "peter@lekensteyn.nl",
      "committed_date": "2023-10-16T18:46:02.000+02:00",
      "trailers": {},
      "extended_trailers": {},
      "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/commit/d975c5353cd0f37e1c56a44306a000423b22579d"
    },
    {
      "id": "575de4a6c7af76542a4df09c858e948e01d76ae2",
      "short_id": "575de4a6",
      "created_at": "2023-10-16T18:46:02.000+02:00",
      "parent_ids": [
        "2907dda30731d436fc8a6663852c8f9249b4637a"
      ],
      "title": "HTTP3: remove nghttp3 min version, update setup scripts",
      "message": "HTTP3: remove nghttp3 min version, update setup scripts\n\n* The QPACK decoder code has not significantly changed since the initial\n  nghttp3 0.1.0 release. The `user_data` field of `nghttp3_mem` was\n  renamed from `mem_user_data` in 0.2.0. Since we do not use it, just\n  remove the field to make it build on Ubuntu 22.04 with 0.1.1.\n* Arch Linux, BSD, Debian, Alpine: add (lib)nghttp3.\n* debian/control: add libnghttp3-dev dependency.\n* brew: Install libnghttp2 instead of nghttp2, we only need the library.\n* brew: libnghttp3 was just made available in Homebrew, so install it:\n  https://github.com/Homebrew/homebrew-core/pull/150922\n\n(cherry picked from commit eca88da1c58a084e97936095f74b6f9e113e5c7a)\n",
      "author_name": "Peter Wu",
      "author_email": "peter@lekensteyn.nl",
      "authored_date": "2023-10-15T15:49:30.000+02:00",
      "committer_name": "Peter Wu",
      "committer_email": "peter@lekensteyn.nl",
      "committed_date": "2023-10-16T18:46:02.000+02:00",
